# Template for ~/.ECCE/CONFIG.localhost -- jobs run directly on this machine.
# `ecce` copies it there on the first start if you have no such file (and no
# site CONFIG.localhost exists); edit your copy, it is never overwritten.
#
# Deliberately no "noRemoteAccess": that flag (see CONFIG.dummy, issue #94)
# makes Launch stop after generating the input, so a file with it here would
# turn every local run into a manual one.
#
# Bare command names, resolved through the PATH of the shell that runs the
# job. gensub dies with "Path for <code> not found" without a value for the
# code being run. To pin a path, replace the bare name, e.g. ORCA: /opt/orca/orca.
NWChem: nwchem
Gaussian-16: g16
Gaussian-09: g09
ORCA: orca
MOPAC: mopac
QuantumESPRESSO: pw.x
perlPath: /usr/bin/perl
